Detail: {detail}
The job will automatically retry on the next interval. If the error persists, check the job's log in the dashboard under Health.

notify.health.host_exceeded:
🚨 *{svcName}: threshold exceeded*
Detail: {detail}
This affects the server FORGE runs on itself – not a single bot. The history is in the dashboard under Health → System.

notify.health.external_unreachable:
🚨 *{svcName} unreachable for ~10 min*
Detail: {detail}
The service doesn't run on this server – a restart won't help here. FORGE keeps checking every 5 min. If it persists, check the history in the dashboard under Health and the provider's status page.

notify.health.service_unreachable:
